0:20.776" end="00:21.064">to </span><span begin="00:21.064" end="00:21.720">stand </span><span begin="00:21.720" end="00:22.160">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.160" end="00:25.168"><span begin="00:22.160" end="00:22.480">It </span><span begin="00:22.480" end="00:23.064">grew </span><span begin="00:23.264" end="00:23.472">it's </span><span begin="00:23.472" end="00:24.040">wings </span><span begin="00:24.208" end="00:24.584">right </span><span begin="00:24.584" end="00:24.808">in </span><span begin="00:24.808" end="00:25.168">place</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.424" end="00:30.597"><span begin="00:25.424" end="00:25.904">We </span><span begin="00:25.904" end="00:26.336">said </span><span begin="00:26.336" end="00:27.045">goodbye </span><span begin="00:27.733" end="00:28.221">one </span><span begin="00:28.221" end="00:28.717">last </span><span begin="00:28.925" end="00:30.597">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.797" end="00:36.077"><span begin="00:30.797" end="00:31.189">As </span><span begin="00:31.677" end="00:32.757">love </span><span begin="00:32.925" end="00:34.165">flew </span><span begin="00:34.165" end="00:36.077">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.453" end="00:41.621"><span begin="00:39.453" end="00:39.893">Looked </span><span begin="00:39.893" end="00:40.253">in </span><span begin="00:40.253" end="00:40.549">my </span><span begin="00:40.549" end="00:41.621">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.021" end="00:46.861"><span begin="00:42.021" end="00:42.501">We </span><span begin="00:42.501" end="00:43.253">only </span><span begin="00:43.253" end="00:44.109">blinked </span><span begin="00:44.301" end="00:44.533">when </span><span begin="00:44.533" end="00:44.765">we </span><span begin="00:44.765" end="00:45.661">started </span><span begin="00:45.893" end="00:46.085">to </span><span begin="00:46.085" end="00:46.861">cry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.565" end="00:49.469"><span begin="00:47.565" end="00:48.093">Both </span><span begin="00:48.093" end="00:48.869">barely </span><span begin="00:48.869" end="00:49.469">dry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.469" end="00:53.485"><span begin="00:49.469" end="00:49.901">When </span><span begin="00:49.901" end="00:50.293">we </span><span begin="00:50.293" end="00:51.525">finally </span><span begin="00:51.861" end="00:52.893">realized </span><span begin="00:53.245" end="00:53.485">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.485" end="00:55.917"><span begin="00:53.485" end="00:53.877">We </span><span begin="00:53.877" end="00:54.197">should </span><span begin="00:54.349" end="00:54.917">break </span><span begin="00:55.173" end="00:55.365">the </span><span begin="00:55.365" end="00:55.917">stare</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.477" end="01:00.085"><span begin="00:56.477" end="00:56.717">And </span><span begin="00:56.717" end="00:57.733">try </span><span begin="00:57.941" end="00:58.213">not </span><span begin="00:58.213" end="00:58.453">to </span><span begin="00:58.453" end="00:59.269">care </span><span begin="00:59.517" end="01:00.085">as</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.221" end="01:03.069"><span begin="01:00.221" end="01:00.469">Love </span><span begin="01:00.469" end="01:01.157">flew </span><span begin="01:01.157" end="01:03.069">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.181" end="01:11.146"><span begin="01:07.181" end="01:07.797">Maybe </span><span begin="01:07.797" end="01:08.085">I'll </span><span begin="01:08.085" end="01:08.733">find </span><span begin="01:08.925" end="01:09.157">you </span><span begin="01:09.157" end="01:09.421">in </span><span begin="01:09.421" end="01:10.213">some </span><span begin="01:10.437" end="01:10.757">other </span><span begin="01:10.957" end="01:11.146">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.146" end="01:12.698"><span begin="01:11.146" end="01:11.626">Some </span><span begin="01:11.626" end="01:12.434">other </span><span begin="01:12.434" end="01:12.698">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.698" end="01:16.738"><span begin="01:12.698" end="01:12.922">We </span><span begin="01:12.922" end="01:13.338">won't </span><span begin="01:13.338" end="01:13.706">be </span><span begin="01:13.706" end="01:14.994">heartbroken </span><span begin="01:14.994" end="01:15.706">half </span><span begin="01:15.898" end="01:16.099">of </span><span begin="01:16.099" end="01:16.354">the </span><span begin="01:16.354" end="01:16.738">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.738" end="01:18.138"><span begin="01:16.738" end="01:17.187">Half </span><span begin="01:17.187" end="01:17.498">of </span><span begin="01:17.498" end="01:17.834">the </span><span begin="01:17.834" end="01:18.138">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.138" end="01:22.394"><span begin="01:18.138" end="01:18.394">The </span><span begin="01:18.394" end="01:18.899">ocean </span><span begin="01:19.122" end="01:19.931">between </span><span begin="01:20.074" end="01:20.306">us </span><span begin="01:20.306" end="01:20.587">won't </span><span begin="01:20.802" end="01:21.171">be </span><span begin="01:21.411" end="01:21.843">so </span><span begin="01:22.075" end="01:22.394">grand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.394" end="01:23.498"><span begin="01:22.394" end="01:22.786">Be </span><span begin="01:22.786" end="01:23.498">so</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.498" end="01:27.962"><span begin="01:23.498" end="01:24.050">Tired </span><span begin="01:24.050" end="01:24.898">after </span><span begin="01:24.898" end="01:25.554">one </span><span begin="01:25.554" end="01:26.266">more </span><span begin="01:26.266" end="01:26.906">one-</span><span begin="01:26.906" end="01:27.346">night </span><span begin="01:27.562" end="01:27.962">stand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.050" end="01:29.833"><span begin="01:28.050" end="01:28.282">One-</span><span begin="01:28.282" end="01:29.010">night </span><span begin="01:29.010" end="01:29.833">stand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.104" end="01:33.537"><span begin="01:30.104" end="01:30.400">But </span><span begin="01:30.400" end="01:30.592">we </span><span begin="01:30.592" end="01:31.233">really </span><span begin="01:31.497" end="01:32.032">couldn't </span><span begin="01:32.032" end="01:33.537">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.112" end="01:40.721"><span begin="01:34.112" end="01:34.400">So </span><span begin="01:34.400" end="01:34.912">we </span><span begin="01:34.912" end="01:35.312">watched </span><span begin="01:35.312" end="01:36.194">love </span><span begin="01:36.592" end="01:37.320">fly </span><span begin="01:37.320" end="01:40.721">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.048" end="01:45.089"><span begin="01:43.048" end="01:43.760">Holding </span><span begin="01:43.760" end="01:44.288">your </span><span begin="01:44.288" end="01:45.089">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.696" end="01:47.683"><span begin="01:45.696" end="01:46.200">Still </span><span begin="01:46.200" end="01:46.712">feels </span><span begin="01:46.712" end="01:47.683">electric</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.931" end="01:50.466"><span begin="01:47.931" end="01:48.339">Like </span><span begin="01:48.595" end="01:48.883">kiss </span><span begin="01:48.883" end="01:49.179">you </span><span begin="01:49.747" end="01:49.907">but </span><span begin="01:49.907" end="01:50.067">I </span><span begin="01:50.067" end="01:50.466">can't</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.178" end="01:53.056"><span begin="01:51.178" end="01:51.778">All </span><span begin="01:51.778" end="01:52.250">out </span><span begin="01:52.250" end="01:52.562">of </span><span begin="01:52.562" end="01:53.056">breath</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.056" end="01:56.104"><span begin="01:53.056" end="01:53.496">So </span><span begin="01:53.496" end="01:53.904">we </span><span begin="01:53.904" end="01:54.824">whisper </span><span begin="01:55.048" end="01:55.664">among </span><span begin="01:55.920" end="01:56.104">us</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.368" end="01:58.904"><span begin="01:56.368" end="01:56.552">For </span><span begin="01:56.552" end="01:56.808">the </span><span begin="01:56.808" end="01:57.184">last </span><span begin="01:57.360" end="01:57.616">time </span><span begin="01:57.840" end="01:58.904">today</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.408" end="02:08.442"><span begin="01:59.408" end="01:59.848">As </span><span begin="01:59.848" end="02:01.746">our </span><span begin="02:01.986" end="02:02.746">love </span><span begin="02:03.002" end="02:04.346">flew </span><span begin="02:04.714" end="02:08.442">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.690" end="02:12.634"><span begin="02:10.690" end="02:11.162">We </span><span begin="02:11.162" end="02:11.570">said </span><span begin="02:11.570" end="02:12.634">goodbye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.062" end="02:20.044"><span begin="02:13.062" end="02:13.508">As </span><span begin="02:14.044" end="02:15.268">love </span><span begin="02:15.268" end="02:16.412">flew </span><span begin="02:16.588" end="02:20.044">away</span></p></div></body></tt>